---
import Button from '@kaynooo/kayjs-ui/button.kay'
import PageSection from '@kaynooo/kayjs-ui/page-section.kay'
---
.h-40.overflow-y-auto
  PageSection(title="Io" level={3} subtitle="Moons of Jupiter" sticky)
    @actions
      Button(label="Save" tone="accent")
    p Volcanic.
    p Tidally heated.
    p Orbits in 1.8 days.
    p Larger than the Moon.
    p Has hundreds of volcanoes.
    p Its surface is renewed by lava.
